<title>UK: UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction announcement -- full details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.5 BLN STG</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.25%</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2007</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: MARCH 26</p>
<p>NOTES: The stock will be fully paid and fungible with stock already in issue and will be strippable when an official gilts strip facility is introduced.</p>
<p>The dividend dates will be June 7 and December 7.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
